      <description><![CDATA[<p>Mac meetings with AirPods in a call are recorded again: at 24 kHz the AAC bit rate asked for was above what the encoder offers, it then refused every write and the meeting became an empty file (moov atom not found). The bit rate now comes from the encoder&apos;s own list; the Mac app warns during the recording if audio stops being saved and reads the length back from the finished file; a failed meeting&apos;s card leads with what the recorder reported.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/dgrassi1984/shaft/releases/tag/v0.82.1">Full release notes</a></p>]]></description>
